```
(3) ws/.env — append (NOT committed; .env is gitignored) the same three values the root .env carries, named DEV_*:
```
DEV_VAPID_PUBLIC=<root .env VAPID_PUBLIC>
DEV_VAPID_PRIVATE=<root .env VAPID_PRIVATE>
DEV_VAPID_SUBJECT=<root .env VAPID_SUBJECT>
```
get_secret (qdrant.ts:10-20) already falls back to the second arg when the store binding's .get() throws on an empty local store, so `pnpm dev:ws`/`dev:all` will now actually send push.

